OL,3,GNEWSA'Winter-ready bear' and 'faeries
OL,4,Aspotted'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWinter preparations are beginning
OL,7,Facross the West Country as temperatures
OL,8,Fhave started to drop.
OL,10,FEven the Bears at Bristol Zoo Project
OL,11,Fhave been piling on the pounds in
OL,12,Fpreparation for the hibernation season.
OL,14,FElsewhere, Faeries have been spotted in
OL,15,FGlastonbury for the town's annual
OL,16,Fmythical-themed ball and fayre.
OL,18,FHere is our weekly round-up of
OL,19,Fphotographs from across the region.
